{"seq":3,"slug":"astro-islands-architecture","title":"Astro 与 Islands 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/frameworks/astro-islands-architecture","wordCount":1284,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"astro-与-islands-架构\">Astro 与 Islands 架构</h1><p>Astro 代表了 2026 年前端渲染光谱的另一个极端：<strong>零 JavaScript 是默认状态，交互是 opt-in 的例外</strong>。与 React 生态中&quot;一切都是组件、组件默认需要水合&quot;的心智模型相反，Astro 的假设是：大部分网页内容是静态的文字和图片，只有少数&quot;岛屿&quot;需要客户端交互。这个假设在内容驱动站点（博客、文档、电商产品页、营销落地页）中高度成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Astro 代表渲染光谱的另一端：<strong>零 JavaScript 是默认状态，交互是 opt-in 的例外</strong>。其 Islands 架构把页面视作&quot;静态 HTML 的海洋&quot;中散落&quot;交互的岛屿&quot;，每个岛屿独立加载、独立水合。<code>client:*</code> 指令精确控制每个岛屿的水合时机（load/idle/visible/media/only），不带指令的框架组件渲染为纯静态 HTML。Astro 5 的 Server Islands（<code>server:defer</code>）把岛屿概念从&quot;需要客户端 JS&quot;扩展到&quot;需要请求时动态数据&quot;，并支持在同一项目中混用多框架组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"islands-架构的核心模型\">Islands 架构的核心模型</h2><p>Islands Architecture（群岛架构）由 Katie Sylor-Miller 于 2019 年提出，Astro 是其最成熟的工业实现。核心思想：页面是一片&quot;静态 HTML 的海洋&quot;，其中散落着若干&quot;交互的岛屿&quot;。每个岛屿独立加载、独立水合，互不影响。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;页面 HTML(静态海洋)&quot;&#10;        H[Header - 纯 HTML]&#10;        N[导航 - 纯 HTML]&#10;        A[文章内容 - 纯 HTML]&#10;        F[Footer - 纯 HTML]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;交互岛屿&quot;&#10;        S[&quot;搜索框 - React Island&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;评论区 - Svelte Island&quot;]&#10;        T[&quot;目录导航 - Vue Island&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    H --&gt; S&#10;    A --&gt; T&#10;    A --&gt; C\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"页面 HTML(静态海洋)\"\n        H[Header - 纯 HTML]\n        N[导航 - 纯 HTML]\n        A[文章内容 - 纯 HTML]\n        F[Footer - 纯 HTML]\n    end\n    subgraph \"交互岛屿\"\n        S[\"搜索框 - React Island\"]\n        C[\"评论区 - Svelte Island\"]\n        T[\"目录导航 - Vue Island\"]\n    end\n    H --&gt; S\n    A --&gt; T\n    A --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>传统 SPA</th>\n<th>RSC 模式</th>\n<th>Islands 模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认 JS 输出</td>\n<td>全量 bundle</td>\n<td>Client Components bundle</td>\n<td>零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互方式</td>\n<td>全局 React 树</td>\n<td>Client Component 边界</td>\n<td>独立岛屿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水合范围</td>\n<td>整棵树</td>\n<td>Client 子树</td>\n<td>单个岛屿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架锁定</td>\n<td>单框架</td>\n<td>React</td>\n<td>多框架混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>岛屿间通信</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>React Context / 状态</td>\n<td>需额外机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"astro-组件与渲染模式\">Astro 组件与渲染模式</h2><p>Astro 的 <code>.astro</code> 组件文件分为两部分：frontmatter（服务端逻辑）和 template（HTML 输出）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"astro\" data-code=\"---&#10;// frontmatter: 在构建时或请求时在服务端执行&#10;import { getProducts } from &#39;../lib/db&#39;;&#10;import ProductCard from &#39;../components/ProductCard.astro&#39;;&#10;import AddToCart from &#39;../components/AddToCart.tsx&#39;; // React 组件&#10;&#10;const products = await getProducts();&#10;---&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- template: 渲染为纯 HTML --&gt;&#10;&lt;section class=&quot;products&quot;&gt;&#10;  {products.map(product =&gt; (&#10;    &lt;div class=&quot;product&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;ProductCard product={product} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;!-- 只有这个组件带交互，成为&quot;岛屿&quot; --&gt;&#10;      &lt;AddToCart client:visible productId={product.id} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  ))}&#10;&lt;/section&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// frontmatter: 在构建时或请求时在服务端执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { getProducts } from '../lib/db';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import AddToCart from '../components/AddToCart.tsx'; // React 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const products = await getProducts();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- template: 渲染为纯 HTML --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;section class=\"products\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {products.map(product => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div class=\"product\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ProductCard product={product} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;!-- 只有这个组件带交互，成为\"岛屿\" --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;AddToCart client:visible productId={product.id} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/section></span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"client-水合指令\">Client 水合指令</h2><p>Astro 通过 <code>client:*</code> 指令精确控制每个岛屿何时加载 JavaScript 并水合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指令</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>client:load</code></td>\n<td>页面加载立即执行</td>\n<td>首屏关键交互（搜索、导航菜单）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>client:idle</code></td>\n<td>浏览器空闲时（<code>requestIdleCallback</code>）</td>\n<td>非紧急交互（反馈表单）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>client:visible</code></td>\n<td>进入视口时（<code>IntersectionObserver</code>）</td>\n<td>页面下方的交互组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>client:media=&quot;(max-width: 768px)&quot;</code></td>\n<td>媒体查询匹配时</td>\n<td>仅移动端需要的交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>client:only=&quot;react&quot;</code></td>\n<td>仅客户端渲染（不 SSR）</td>\n<td>依赖浏览器 API 的组件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>不带任何 <code>client:*</code> 指令的框架组件会被渲染为静态 HTML，<strong>不发送任何 JavaScript</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"astro\" data-code=\"---&#10;import Chart from &#39;../components/Chart.tsx&#39;;&#10;---&#10;&lt;!-- 无 client 指令：Chart 在构建时渲染为 SVG/HTML，零 JS --&gt;&#10;&lt;Chart data={salesData} /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 带 client:visible：进入视口时加载 React + Chart 代码 --&gt;&#10;&lt;Chart client:visible data={salesData} interactive={true} /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import Chart from '../components/Chart.tsx';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 无 client 指令：Chart 在构建时渲染为 SVG/HTML，零 JS --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Chart data={salesData} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 带 client:visible：进入视口时加载 React + Chart 代码 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Chart client:visible data={salesData} interactive={true} /></span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"server-islands-astro-5\">Server Islands（Astro 5）</h2><p>Server Islands 是 Astro 5 引入的突破性特性——将&quot;岛屿&quot;概念从客户端扩展到服务端。传统 Islands 解决的是&quot;哪些组件需要客户端 JS&quot;的问题；Server Islands 解决的是&quot;哪些组件需要请求时动态数据&quot;的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"astro\" data-code=\"---&#10;import Cart from &#39;../components/Cart.astro&#39;;&#10;import UserAvatar from &#39;../components/UserAvatar.astro&#39;;&#10;---&#10;&#10;&lt;html&gt;&#10;&lt;body&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 静态：构建时渲染，CDN 缓存 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;h1&gt;产品目录&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;  &lt;ProductList /&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;!-- Server Island：每次请求时在服务端渲染 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;Cart server:defer&gt;&#10;    &lt;CartSkeleton slot=&quot;fallback&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/Cart&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;UserAvatar server:defer&gt;&#10;    &lt;AvatarPlaceholder slot=&quot;fallback&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/UserAvatar&gt;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import Cart from '../components/Cart.astro';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import UserAvatar from '../components/UserAvatar.astro';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;html></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- 静态：构建时渲染，CDN 缓存 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;h1>产品目录&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;ProductList /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- Server Island：每次请求时在服务端渲染 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;Cart server:defer></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;CartSkeleton slot=\"fallback\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/Cart></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;UserAvatar server:defer></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;AvatarPlaceholder slot=\"fallback\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/UserAvatar></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/html></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>server:defer</code> 的运行时行为：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant CDN as CDN/Edge&#10;    participant B as 浏览器&#10;    participant S as Origin 服务器&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;CDN: GET /products&#10;    CDN--&gt;&gt;B: 静态 Shell(含 fallback 占位符)&#10;    Note over B: 用户立即看到页面内容 + skeleton&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: 并行请求 Server Islands&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 渲染 Cart(含用户购物车数据)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 渲染 UserAvatar(含登录状态)&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;B: Cart HTML 片段&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;B: UserAvatar HTML 片段&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: 替换占位符 → 页面完整\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant CDN as CDN/Edge\n    participant B as 浏览器\n    participant S as Origin 服务器\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;CDN: GET /products\n    CDN--&gt;&gt;B: 静态 Shell(含 fallback 占位符)\n    Note over B: 用户立即看到页面内容 + skeleton\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: 并行请求 Server Islands\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 渲染 Cart(含用户购物车数据)\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 渲染 UserAvatar(含登录状态)\n    S--&gt;&gt;B: Cart HTML 片段\n    S--&gt;&gt;B: UserAvatar HTML 片段\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: 替换占位符 → 页面完整</pre><p>Server Islands 与 Next.js PPR 的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Astro Server Islands</th>\n<th>Next.js PPR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输方式</td>\n<td>独立 HTTP 请求（可并行）</td>\n<td>同一 HTTP 流内注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存粒度</td>\n<td>每个 Island 独立 Cache-Control</td>\n<td>页面级别（壳 vs 动态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架依赖</td>\n<td>任意（Astro/React/Vue/Svelte）</td>\n<td>React Server Components</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水合</td>\n<td>纯 HTML 替换（无 JS）</td>\n<td>可能触发 Client Component 水合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟感知</td>\n<td>可能有两次网络往返</td>\n<td>单次请求内流式完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多框架组件混合\">多框架组件混合</h2><p>Astro 的独特优势：在同一个项目中混用 React、Vue、Svelte、Solid、Preact 组件作为 Islands：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"astro\" data-code=\"---&#10;import ReactCounter from &#39;../components/Counter.tsx&#39;;&#10;import SvelteChart from &#39;../components/Chart.svelte&#39;;&#10;import VueForm from &#39;../components/ContactForm.vue&#39;;&#10;---&#10;&#10;&lt;main&gt;&#10;  &lt;h1&gt;多框架岛屿演示&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;!-- React 岛屿 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;ReactCounter client:load initialCount={0} /&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;!-- Svelte 岛屿 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;SvelteChart client:visible data={chartData} /&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;!-- Vue 岛屿 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;VueForm client:idle endpoint=&quot;/api/contact&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/main&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import ReactCounter from '../components/Counter.tsx';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import SvelteChart from '../components/Chart.svelte';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import VueForm from '../components/ContactForm.vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;h1>多框架岛屿演示&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- React 岛屿 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;ReactCounter client:load initialCount={0} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- Svelte 岛屿 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;SvelteChart client:visible data={chartData} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- Vue 岛屿 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;VueForm client:idle endpoint=\"/api/contact\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/main></span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个岛屿只加载自己框架的运行时。如果页面只有一个 React 岛屿和一个 Svelte 岛屿，客户端只会加载 <code>react</code> + <code>react-dom</code>（用于第一个）和 <code>svelte</code>（用于第二个），而不是整个应用的 bundle。</p>\n<h2 id=\"content-layer-api\">Content Layer API</h2><p>Astro 5 的 Content Layer 提供类型安全的数据获取抽象，支持任意数据源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// src/content/config.ts&#10;import { defineCollection, z } from &#39;astro:content&#39;;&#10;import { glob } from &#39;astro/loaders&#39;;&#10;&#10;const blog = defineCollection({&#10;  loader: glob({ pattern: &#39;**/*.md&#39;, base: &#39;./src/data/blog&#39; }),&#10;  schema: z.object({&#10;    title: z.string(),&#10;    pubDate: z.coerce.date(),&#10;    tags: z.array(z.string()).default([]),&#10;  }),&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const collections = { blog };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/content/config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineCollection, z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'astro:content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { glob } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'astro/loaders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blog</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineCollection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  loader: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">glob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ pattern: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'**/*.md'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, base: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/data/blog'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pubDate: z.coerce.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tags: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> collections</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { blog };</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能基准\">性能基准</h2><p>基于 2026 年实际站点对比（同一内容，不同框架）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>Next.js 16 (RSC)</th>\n<th>Astro 5 (Islands)</th>\n<th>纯 SPA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TTFB</td>\n<td>40ms</td>\n<td>20ms (CDN)</td>\n<td>30ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCP</td>\n<td>200ms (PPR)</td>\n<td>180ms</td>\n<td>2.1s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端 JS</td>\n<td>89kB</td>\n<td>4kB</td>\n<td>340kB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lighthouse 性能分</td>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>99</td>\n<td>62</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施成本</td>\n<td>$$$</td>\n<td>$ (大部分静态)</td>\n<td>$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"适用场景决策\">适用场景决策</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Astro 适合度</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mtext>静态内容占比</mtext><mtext>交互组件占比</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Astro 适合度} \\propto \\frac{\\text{静态内容占比}}{\\text{交互组件占比}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Astro </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">适合度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">交互组件占比</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">静态内容占比</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li>比值 &gt; 5：Astro 是最优选（文档站、博客、营销页）</li>\n<li>比值 2-5：Astro 仍有优势，但需更多 Islands 设计思考</li>\n<li>比值 &lt; 2：考虑 Next.js/Remix（交互密集应用）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Islands 架构把页面视为静态 HTML 海洋 + 若干独立水合的交互岛屿，零 JS 是默认</li>\n<li><code>client:load/idle/visible/media/only</code> 精确控制每个岛屿的水合时机，无指令则输出纯静态 HTML</li>\n<li>Server Islands（<code>server:defer</code>）把岛屿扩展到请求时动态数据，用 fallback 占位后独立请求替换</li>\n<li>Server Islands 与 Next.js PPR 的差异：独立 HTTP 请求 + 每岛 Cache-Control，而非同一流内注入</li>\n<li>多框架混合让每个岛屿只加载自己框架的运行时，而非整站 bundle</li>\n<li>选型判据是静态内容占比与交互组件占比的比值：&gt;5 优选 Astro，&lt;2 考虑 Next.js/Remix</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上一篇 <a href=\"remix-loader-action\">Remix Loader/Action 模式</a> 展示了 Web 标准的数据流方案。本篇展示了内容优先的渲染方案。三者共同构成了 2026 年前端服务端渲染的框架光谱。第四章将聚焦跨框架通用的优化技术：<a href=\"../optimization/partial-prerendering\">部分预渲染</a>、边缘渲染、缓存策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Astro 与 Islands 架构","id":"astro-与-islands-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Islands 架构的核心模型","id":"islands-架构的核心模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Astro 组件与渲染模式","id":"astro-组件与渲染模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Client 水合指令","id":"client-水合指令"},{"level":2,"text":"Server Islands（Astro 5）","id":"server-islands-astro-5"},{"level":2,"text":"多框架组件混合","id":"多框架组件混合"},{"level":2,"text":"Content Layer API","id":"content-layer-api"},{"level":2,"text":"性能基准","id":"性能基准"},{"level":2,"text":"适用场景决策","id":"适用场景决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Remix Loader/Action 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/frameworks/remix-loader-action"},"next":{"title":"部分预渲染（PPR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/optimization/partial-prerendering"}}